WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.380
Yeah!

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.630
Oh, Karen...

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.400
Shino!

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.680
Shino, look!

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:13.930
Sushi!

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.310
One of those fake restaurant samples?

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.480
Foreigners love these.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:21.200
I saw it on TV.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.230
Look!

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.790
This looks just like the real thing!

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.690
Don't eat it by mistake.

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:30.400
Hey, sushi! That looks good!

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:32.030
Mine!

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:37.600
The quality is so high, it even fools
Japanese people! Amazing!

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.410
You should've noticed as soon as you touched it.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:45.640
I get really hungry this time of year.

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:46.250
Growl

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:47.830
It's not even summer yet.

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:49.920
Then how do you feel about this, Youko?

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.430
Looking for
Challengers!!!

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:54.430
Finish and
it's free!!

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:52.900
Finish it in 30 minutes and it's free!

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:54.430
It's the "Insane Parfait"!

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:57.610
They even named it "insane"!

00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:00.690
They were handing these out
on the street the other day.

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:04.060
You're not really thinking of trying
an eating contest, are you, Yo—

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:08.010
This just might be what I was born for!

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.860
You were born for <i>that?!</i>

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:48.380
Episode 6
The Girl on My Mind

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:52.760
It should be right around here...

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.740
Oh, this is it!

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:58.540
What a cute little store.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:58.970
Today's Lunch Menu

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:58.970
Napolitan!
Hamburg Steak!

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:03.220
Somehow, it smells like England.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:04.460
Really?

00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:06.920
Let's go!

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:07.850
All right!

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:09.360
Wait, Youko!

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:13.040
Did you bring money in case
you fail the challenge?

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:16.740
Don't worry! I'll definitely succeed!

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:18.430
How much did you bring?

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:19.410
Well...

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:22.490
Have faith in me! I won't lose!

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:28.750
Welcome!

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:34.310
Welcome.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:37.380
<i>Wh-Why are Karen-chan and her friends here?</i>

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.600
Honoka, we have customers.

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:41.070
Take them some water.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.390
O-Okay.

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.260
<i>If I go out like this, they'll recognize me!</i>

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:46.390
<i>I'm so embarrassed!</i>

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:53.060
W-Welcome.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:54.150
What's that?

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:56.510
That sounds like Honoka's voice.

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:57.790
<i>She knows!</i>

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:58.910
Honoka?

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:00.910
Is that you, Matsubara-san?

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:08.030
You work here?

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.330
What kind of job is this?

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:11.670
Well, actually...

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.320
My family runs this shop.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.810
What?!

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:18.510
Sometimes, I help out on weekends.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.410
A poster girl! You're a poster girl!

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:22.970
The store's idol!

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:25.010
K-Keep your voices down.

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:27.860
You've never met Youko-chan before, have you?

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:31.410
This is Matsubara Honoka-chan from our class.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.830
Hey! Nice to meet you, Honoka.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:36.040
Wait, you can't use her first name already!

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.280
That's way too familiar!

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:40.210
They say yesterday's
enemies are today's allies.

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:40.910
Enemy?!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.800
Call me Youko.

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:45.480
Okay, Youko-chan.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:46.910
Okay, down to business.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:49.160
One "Insane Parfait," please!

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:51.380
A challenger, eh?

00:04:51.900 --> 00:04:53.290
Coming right up.

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:54.880
What about everyone else?

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.670
Well...

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.170
<i>Maybe I'm being rude!</i>

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.930
<i>I should be more respectful and kneel!</i>

00:05:02.330 --> 00:05:05.680
I am yours to command, mistress!

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.950
Oh! A maid café!

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.430
Thank you for waiting.

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.210
It's really intimidating in person.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.840
Don't force yourself.

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:20.440
Don't worry. This'll be easy!

00:05:20.910 --> 00:05:23.030
Why are you so confident?

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:26.840
I'm a girl, so I love sweets.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.040
You're trying to act girly now?!

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:37.380
It's delicious! I'm in heaven!

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:41.100
By the way, how much does it
cost if she doesn't finish it?

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.300
8,000 yen.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:45.050
What?! 8,000 yen?

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.520
Youko, come on!

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:48.880
You can do it, Youko! Fight!

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:51.200
Thanks, guys!

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:54.210
Youko-chan, you're amazing.

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:57.450
Just looking at it makes me feel full.

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:00.290
Watching her is making me hungry.

00:05:59.230 --> 00:06:00.440
Growl

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:00.820
What?!

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.600
Want to order something?

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:03.710
Excuse me...

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.570
Yes, coming!

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.540
What are you doing, Karen?

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:18.050
Karen-chan said she'd help out.

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:21.090
Yeah! I've always wanted to try working!

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:22.300
How wonderful.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:24.340
Honoka-chan, thank you so much.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:26.590
Can I order now?

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:28.100
You sure can.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:31.600
<i>Karen-chan's bearing is so elegant...</i>

00:06:32.420 --> 00:06:34.410
<i>Our store has been transformed</i>

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:36.850
<i>into a stylish foreign restaurant.</i>

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:39.730
<i>I should learn from her.</i>

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:41.690
That'll be all.

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:42.780
With pleasure!

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:45.600
Boss, one Hamburg steak meal!

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.840
Karen-chan, not that way!

00:06:53.620 --> 00:06:54.870
It's so good.

00:06:55.120 --> 00:06:57.000
Karen, I'll take your picture.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.750
Make it cute!

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.190
Yeah!

00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.260
I'll e-mail it to you later.

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:05.580
Aya-chan, send it to me, too.

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:08.010
Shino, you don't have a cell phone.

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:09.240
Print it out.

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:10.140
Okay, sure.

00:07:15.110 --> 00:07:16.390
<i>She's lucky.</i>

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:20.580
<i>I wish I could get Karen-chan's e-mail address.</i>

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:29.030
I borrowed an apron.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:32.030
Waitress Angel Alice!

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.340
What do you recommend?

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:37.540
What? U-Um...

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:41.290
E-Everything's delicious,
so I recommend everything!

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.670
I'll take the whole store, please!

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.800
Certainly!

00:07:49.140 --> 00:07:51.680
<i>Huh? There's still so much...</i>

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:55.450
<i>And I'm getting cold.</i>

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:59.340
<i>My body is rejecting the parfait.</i>

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:03.190
<i>I never thought I would lose...</i>

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:04.440
How vexing!

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:05.710
Youko-chan!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.150
Youko! Be strong!

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:08.320
You've come far enough!

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:11.340
It really was insane, like the name said?

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:12.400
How terrifying.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:14.450
We'll finish the rest.

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:16.560
You did your best, Youko.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:18.200
Aya...

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:20.960
You gained a lot from this experience...

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:22.940
Especially calories!

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.560
It was all for nothing!

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:29.150
A DIFFERENT DAY

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:29.220
Congratulations!

00:08:29.620 --> 00:08:31.300
You finished the parfait!

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:36.720
Thanks for the food.

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:40.030
<i>It was good, but I ate too much...</i>

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:43.520
<i>Nah, I'll cut back on sweets
for a month, so it'll be fine.</i>

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.950
<i>I'd be embarrassed if any
of my students saw me.</i>

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:49.460
<i>I should leave while I can...</i>

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:50.660
Amazing...

00:09:02.150 --> 00:09:04.970
Your e-mails are so blunt, Youko.

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:05.930
Really?

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:07.460
You don't use enough emoticons!

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:11.240
You should put hearts all
over them, like Ayaya does!

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:13.550
I don't use them that much!

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:15.220
Okay, then...

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:25.480
How's this? <3

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:20.590
<i>How's this?</i>

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:25.480
Not that I really care <3

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:22.550
<i>Not that I really care.</i>

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:23.230
I'm

00:09:22.550 --> 00:09:23.230
<i>I'm</i>

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:23.730
I'm so <3

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:23.730
<i>I'm so</i>

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:24.230
I'm so <3 so <3

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:24.230
<i>I'm so so</i>

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:24.730
I'm so <3 so <3 hun <3

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:24.730
<i>I'm so so hun</i>

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:25.480
I'm so <3 so <3 hun <3 gry <3

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:25.480
<i>I'm so so hungry.</i>

00:09:25.760 --> 00:09:29.110
Imagining it in your voice gives me goosebumps.

00:09:29.510 --> 00:09:31.810
I just did what you said!

00:09:34.710 --> 00:09:38.510
<i>Are Karen-chan's e-mails
in broken Japanese, too?</i>

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:41.870
<i>I'm sure she'd give me her
address if I asked for it, but...</i>

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:43.220
Could I possibly...

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:46.600
You'll have to go through our agency for that.

00:09:46.600 --> 00:09:47.880
She has people to do it for her!

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.960
That's totally possible!

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:53.140
Honoka-chan, are you not feeling well?

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:54.470
Shinobu-chan...

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:57.140
No, it's nothing.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:59.470
You have a blonde hair on your shoulder.

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:00.560
What?

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:07.610
This waviness... It belongs to Alice.

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:09.500
<i>Gulp.</i>

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:13.780
Putting it in my wallet might
give me better luck with money.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:15.050
Yeah, maybe!

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.950
No, wait, I'm not sure about that...

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:19.900
I've actually been wanting to discuss

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:22.410
the love of blonde hair with you.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:23.660
Me, too.

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:28.100
Shino?

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:33.130
Blonde hair... Blonde hair... Blonde hair...

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.300
<i>They seem really excited about something.</i>

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:36.560
Blonde hair!

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:38.050
Grab!

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:42.700
The Blonde Alliance

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:40.710
The Blonde Alliance!

00:10:40.710 --> 00:10:42.810
What just happened?!

00:10:42.810 --> 00:10:46.310
The Blonde Girls' Club

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:46.310
I had no idea we had so much in common.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:50.820
Honoka-chan, you want Karen's
e-mail address, don't you?

00:10:51.210 --> 00:10:52.430
Don't worry.

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:55.200
Alice and Karen are ordinary girls on the inside.

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:57.500
You should just be direct.

00:10:57.800 --> 00:11:00.870
Thank you. I'll find the courage to ask.

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:09.960
Squeeze

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:07.910
Is something wrong, Alice?

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:09.640
Nothing's wrong!

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:14.550
<i>Maybe I'm overthinking it, but...</i>

00:11:14.550 --> 00:11:18.470
<i>Just asking for her e-mail address out
of the blue seems like hitting on her.</i>

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:20.970
Give me your e-mail address!

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:22.650
<i>Like that!</i>

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:26.070
Matsubara-san, you've been staring for a while.

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:27.310
Do you need something from Karen?

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:29.900
No! I'm just waiting for my chance...

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:31.400
I'm not hitting on her!

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:32.220
Huh?!

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:35.120
Karen's e-mail address?

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.190
I see. So that's what it was.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:42.180
Yeah. Oh, and you can call me Honoka.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:42.950
Really?

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:44.750
Okay, Honoka.

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:48.220
You always give Karen sweets, don't you?

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.590
Why not include a message?

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:52.340
Tell me your
e-mail address

00:11:50.590 --> 00:11:52.060
Nice idea!

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:55.340
Karen-chan, want some sweets?

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:58.860
Th-There's nothing in them, so it's okay!

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:59.180
PANT

00:11:58.860 --> 00:11:59.920
Don't worry!

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.400
She's acting too suspicious!

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:03.190
What should I do?

00:12:03.190 --> 00:12:05.470
Karen-chan is wary of me now!

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:08.100
And I forgot to put my message in the box!

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:10.350
Tell me your
e-mail address

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:10.350
You're such a klutz! Not that I'm one to talk!

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:18.930
<i>It makes more sense for me to
just watch from a distance...</i>

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.120
A different class...

00:12:19.410 --> 00:12:20.790
<i>She's of a different class...</i>

00:12:20.790 --> 00:12:23.580
Honoka-chan, that's a fantastic story!

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:24.490
Squee

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:24.490
What is?!

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.640
We're the Blonde Alliance!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.890
I'll cheer for you!

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:30.600
Shinobu-chan...

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:33.130
Okay! I'll give it another try!

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:37.680
Honoka's charging toward the finish line!

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.510
Karen-chan!

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:38.510
You're commentating?!

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:41.120
She tripped!

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:42.260
She's a total klutz!

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:47.880
Honoka, are you okay?

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:50.140
Your halo is blinding me...

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:55.400
Um, Karen-chan, could I
have your e-mail address?

00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:56.730
Yes!

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:00.280
Come to think of it, I don't have yours!

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:01.610
I'm like Hachibei the Forgetful!

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:05.090
I guess that makes me Kyubei.

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:06.470
What does that mean?

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:16.700
From: Karen-chan
Sub: First E-mail

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:17.850
<i>Karen-chan's e-mails weren't
in broken Japanese after all.</i>

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:25.930
Honoka-chan, you have dark
circles under your eyes!

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:27.470
Are you okay?

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:31.610
Karen-chan wouldn't stop e-mailing me...

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:35.940
Hello!!
Kin-iro Mosaic

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:39.990
Hello!!
Kin-iro Mosaic

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:46.540
Sensei!

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:51.020
<i>I'm 2-A's homeroom teacher, Kuzehashi Akari.</i>

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:53.800
Teach us how to use sewing machines.

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:56.220
I tried making this yesterday, but...

00:13:56.220 --> 00:14:00.380
<i>Lately, I've finally become
more confident as a teacher.</i>

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:01.800
Women's Toilet

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.220
<i>Oh, no. My face is drooping.</i>

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:08.260
<i>If my students see me like this...</i>

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:10.330
Stare...

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:20.400
Thank you very much.

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:23.470
You were smiling to yourself.

00:14:23.470 --> 00:14:25.310
I-I wasn't smiling!

00:14:25.310 --> 00:14:27.060
Don't make it sound so weird!

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.190
Karen.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:30.810
Hello, Sensei.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:33.290
Karen, do you understand the grammar here?

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:34.630
No.

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:36.420
Look at it before you answer.

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:38.000
Which one?

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:40.230
But it's classical grammar...

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.500
<i>Classics...</i>

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.510
Leave it to me!

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:47.320
Until just recently, I was in high school myself!

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:54.240
I typically scored four or five one a scale
of five in Japanese Language tests.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.950
Wow!

00:14:58.170 --> 00:14:59.770
Please believe me!

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:00.920
Sensei?

00:15:03.140 --> 00:15:05.920
I can only teach you about my subject.

00:15:05.920 --> 00:15:07.860
I'm not very good at classics.

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:11.460
Then do you know which country
has upside-down animals?

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:14.320
Karen, that's a riddle!

00:15:14.320 --> 00:15:15.410
Is it Romania?

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:19.500
Romania

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:18.100
It kind of sounds like "animal" backwards.

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:19.540
That was quick!

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.740
I-Incredible!

00:15:21.740 --> 00:15:24.050
I'm impressed, Karasuma-sensei...

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:39.660
The sounds of club activities fill
the school after classes are out.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.360
Like the sounds of wind instruments and balls.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:43.800
Yeah.

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:45.710
Sensei!

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:47.200
Hi, girls.

00:15:47.970 --> 00:15:49.440
On your way home?

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:50.400
Yes.

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:52.200
You're in the Going Home Club?

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:53.740
I'm in the Shino Club.

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:55.040
I see...

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:58.280
Which clubs were you in as students?

00:15:58.280 --> 00:15:59.710
When we were students?

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:02.680
I was on the track and field team.

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:05.410
An athletics club? I'm surprised.

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:06.460
Really?

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:07.920
That's amazing!

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:10.340
Kuzehashi-sensei, are you a fast runner?

00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:13.720
<i>Is that a gaze of respect?</i>

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:16.760
You may be quick to escape, Kujou-san,

00:16:16.760 --> 00:16:19.150
but I can run fast enough to catch you.

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:22.800
I was in the Theater Club.

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:26.170
I'd like to see you act.

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:27.740
What? Right now?

00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:30.850
But I can't refuse a request.

00:16:30.850 --> 00:16:32.600
Let's do our best.

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:33.990
What? Me, too?

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.930
We'll be doing <i>Cinderella</i>.

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:37.950
Cinderella

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:37.950
Stepmother

00:16:38.460 --> 00:16:39.620
Scrub, scrub...

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:40.850
Scrub, scrub...

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.530
Look at all this dust.

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:44.750
You're worthless, Cinderella!

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:47.500
I'm sorry, Stepmother.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:48.760
Scrub, scrub...

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:53.590
Scrub, scrub...

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:53.980
She doesn't seem that unhappy
when she's smiling like that.

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:57.780
Cinderella considers it a reward!

00:16:57.780 --> 00:16:59.890
You can't just change the story!

00:17:00.110 --> 00:17:02.960
When you were in high school, huh?

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:05.050
I wonder what they were like.

00:17:05.050 --> 00:17:06.150
I'm curious.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:11.240
We both graduated from this school.

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.240
What? Really?

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.570
You too, Kusshi-chan?

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:15.160
Yes.

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:17.270
Were you classmates?

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:19.810
No, we were two years apart.

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:23.290
Don't tell them! I'm at a delicate age!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:24.950
Don't

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:25.120
<i>Maybe I shouldn't say anything.</i>

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:28.650
What were you like as a student, Sensei?

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:31.050
I was just a normal student.

00:17:31.370 --> 00:17:34.640
I can't imagine you in a uniform.

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:37.310
How rude. I looked great in mine!

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:40.280
Of course, I can't really wear it now.

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:45.100
Forgot that she wore
hers to the year-end party

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:49.550
I actually carry photos
from high school with me.

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:50.190
Why?!

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:52.200
Let me see!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.120
It really looks like you.

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:56.900
The ribbon's a different color than ours.

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:58.700
You didn't have your glasses yet.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:00.930
You're so cute, Karasuma-sensei.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.460
You were beautiful back then, too.

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:03.460
What?!

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:05.020
What is it?

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:05.950
Nothing.

00:18:05.950 --> 00:18:09.070
I've never seen this before, either,
so it just surprised me.

00:18:09.070 --> 00:18:09.840
Surprised?

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:28.980
Kuzehashi Akari (15)

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:27.510
<i>It's been a few days, but I'm
still not used to my new school.</i>

00:18:27.810 --> 00:18:29.610
<i>I hope I'll be okay.</i>

00:18:30.640 --> 00:18:33.240
<i>Think positive, think positive!</i>

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.990
I'm sorry! Are you okay?

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:39.580
<i>An upperclassman! What should I do?</i>

00:18:37.570 --> 00:18:41.450
Karasuma Sakura (17)

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:41.870
I'm okay.

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:45.840
I dropped the key to Classroom LL.

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:47.800
But I found it.

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:48.670
I see...

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:52.010
I was asked to go lock up, but...

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.790
Where's Classroom LL, again?

00:18:54.790 --> 00:18:56.440
<i>What? Senpai...</i>

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:58.820
Well, it happens all the time, right?

00:18:58.820 --> 00:18:59.920
No, it doesn't!

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:02.300
School Store

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:03.200
Okay, that's 150 yen. Thank you.

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.580
Next, please.

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:09.310
Thanks for showing me the way.

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:12.700
<i>What a weird girl...</i>

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:15.530
We're sold out.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:16.410
What?!

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:18.780
School  Store 

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:26.700
I'd like to thank you for earlier.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.630
Where were you keeping that?!

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:36.610
I see. You're still not used
to high school life, huh?

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:40.270
But don't worry. You'll get used to it soon.

00:19:40.270 --> 00:19:41.640
Oh, I know!

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:44.380
I'll sing a song to cheer you on.

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:47.230
Totem pole...

00:19:48.210 --> 00:19:50.920
Totem pole...

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:54.630
High school life...

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:57.650
Totem life.

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:00.690
<i>She's singing her heart out...</i>

00:20:00.690 --> 00:20:02.030
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:05.350
Do your best "pole"...

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:11.790
Thank you very much.

00:20:12.090 --> 00:20:14.610
I love this school.

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:17.300
It's my dream to teach here someday.

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:19.470
It's such a wonderful school.

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:22.180
I hope you'll enjoy it here, too.

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:25.960
Oh, gosh! I sound like a school promoter.

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.660
You smiled.

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:31.570
That must have been Karasuma-sensei!

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:33.730
Why didn't I realize it before now?

00:20:33.730 --> 00:20:34.940
Kuzehashi-sensei?

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:38.480
So you two knew each other!

00:20:38.480 --> 00:20:39.950
Th-That's right!

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:44.080
Karasuma-sensei, from now on,
can I call you "Senpai"?

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:47.100
I-It's true that I'm a <i>little</i> older than you,

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:49.050
but we teach the same year.

00:20:49.050 --> 00:20:50.980
I consider us equals.

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:53.040
You're right! I'm sorry!

00:20:53.790 --> 00:20:55.310
Goodbye, Sensei!

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:56.590
Bye!

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:57.720
Bye!

00:20:57.720 --> 00:20:59.270
Goodbye.

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.500
Take care.

00:21:04.050 --> 00:21:06.840
I can't compare to you, Karasuma-sensei.

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:09.010
That's not true.

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:12.480
You're a much better teacher than I am.

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:16.610
Students remember everything
you say, even in passing.

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:21.200
Your words have probably
saved lots of students.

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:29.170
Yes, you're right!

00:23:01.470 --> 00:23:04.660
Karasuma-sensei, do you look up to anyone?

00:23:04.660 --> 00:23:06.660
I look up to you!

00:23:06.660 --> 00:23:08.430
Well...

00:23:10.300 --> 00:23:12.430
Maybe Fukuzawa Yukichi.

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:14.470
<i>I wouldn't expect anything
less from you, Sensei!</i>

00:23:14.130 --> 00:23:16.340
Scholar

00:23:14.920 --> 00:23:16.340
Teacher

00:23:16.340 --> 00:23:19.590
<i>I want to go to an all-you-can-eat place...</i>

00:23:18.630 --> 00:23:20.840
Yukichi

00:23:21.570 --> 00:23:24.750
Honoka, why do you give me so many sweets?

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:25.390
What?

00:23:25.690 --> 00:23:28.450
<i>I can't say "Because it makes you smile."</i>

00:23:25.970 --> 00:23:30.640
Blush

00:23:28.450 --> 00:23:30.850
<i>It's so embarrassing to be asked like that!</i>

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:33.440
Hee
Hee
Hee

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:33.440
Fidget                                  Fidget

00:23:31.060 --> 00:23:32.360
To fatten you up!

00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:33.930
You want to eat me?!

00:23:32.390 --> 00:23:33.440
Jump

00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:35.900
#7    My Dear Hero

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:34.820
See ya!

00:23:34.820 --> 00:23:35.900
See you later!
